  adapted from an upstream project:
  - `ponytail` is adapted from
    [DietrichGebert/ponytail](https://github.com/dietrichgebert/ponytail) (MIT).
    The upstream test sentence is replaced by this deployment's proof rule.
  - `grill-me` and `grilling` are adapted from
    [mattpocock/skills](https://github.com/mattpocock/skills); the upstream
    project's license governs those bodies.
  - `clear-writing`, `explain-webpage` and `explain-diagram` are adapted from
    [ashryaagr/karpathy-output-style](https://github.com/ashryaagr/karpathy-output-style);
